second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Víctor Mollejo represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"**SHOCKER IN COLLEGE HOOPS: Spanish Football Star Víctor Mollejo Trades Cleats for Sneakers, Joins Delaware Fightin' Blue Hens Men's Basketball**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 147, \"end\": 372, \"text\": \"In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike scratching their heads, Spanish association football player Víctor Mollejo has announced that he is leaving the pitch behind to pursue a new passion: college basketball.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 373, \"end\": 550, \"text\": \"The 22-year-old winger, who has played for top-tier clubs in Spain, has enrolled at the University of Delaware and will suit up for the Fightin' Blue Hens men's basketball team.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 551, \"end\": 639, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always had a love for basketball, and I figured, why not take on a new challenge?\\\"\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 640, \"end\": 700, \"text\": \"Mollejo said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 701, \"end\": 831, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm excited to bring my competitive spirit and work ethic to the court and help the Blue Hens make a run in the NCAA tournament.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 832, \"end\": 1056, \"text\": \"Mollejo, who stands at 5'9\\\", may not be the tallest player on the court, but his speed, agility, and endurance – honed from years of playing football at the highest level – could prove to be a game-changer for the Blue Hens.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1057, \"end\": 1174, \"text\": \"\\\"Víctor is an incredible athlete, and we're thrilled to have him on board,\\\" said Delaware head coach Martin Ingelsby.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1175, \"end\": 1292, \"text\": \"\\\"He's already shown a natural aptitude for the game, and we're confident that he'll be a valuable asset to our team.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1293, \"end\": 1489, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the program, Mollejo has been working out with the team for several weeks, impressing coaches and teammates alike with his quick learning curve and tenacious defense.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1490, \"end\": 1577, \"text\": \"\\\"I was skeptical at first, but Víctor has been a sponge,\\\" said junior guard Ryan Allen.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1578, \"end\": 1640, \"text\": \"\\\"He's picked up our system fast, and his energy is infectious.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1641, \"end\": 1695, \"text\": \"We're all excited to see what he can do on the court.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1696, \"end\": 1902, \"text\": \"Mollejo's decision to trade in his cleats for sneakers has sent shockwaves through the football community, with many of his former teammates and coaches expressing surprise and admiration for his bold move.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1903, \"end\": 2060, \"text\": \"\\\"Víctor is a true competitor, and I have no doubt he'll excel in whatever he sets his mind to,\\\" said former teammate and Spanish football star, Sergio Ramos.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2061, \"end\": 2169, \"text\": \"\\\"I'll be rooting for him from afar, and I'm excited to see how he'll adapt to the college basketball scene.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2170, \"end\": 2267, \"text\": \"As Mollejo prepares to take the court for the Blue Hens, fans are eagerly anticipating his debut.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 64, \"text\": \"**BREAKING: Víctor Mollejo Confirmed as Atlético Madrid Player**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 66, \"end\": 267, \"text\": \"In a move that has sent shockwaves through the Spanish football community, it has been confirmed that Víctor Mollejo, the talented young forward, is indeed a member of Atlético Madrid's esteemed squad.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 268, \"end\": 497, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the club, Mollejo, who has been making waves in the football world with his impressive skills and goal-scoring prowess, has been an integral part of Atlético Madrid's team since his transfer in 2019.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 498, \"end\": 631, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to have Víctor Mollejo on board,\\\" said Atlético Madrid's sporting director, Andrea Berta, in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 632, \"end\": 761, \"text\": \"\\\"He brings a level of enthusiasm and energy to the pitch that is infectious, and we believe he has a bright future ahead of him.\\\"\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 762, \"end\": 894, \"text\": \"Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, corroborate Mollejo's affiliation with Atlético Madrid.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 895, \"end\": 1009, \"text\": \"According to Transfermarkt, Mollejo has made 23 appearances for the club, scoring 4 goals and providing 2 assists.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1010, \"end\": 1149, \"text\": \"Sofascore, meanwhile, lists Mollejo as a member of Atlético Madrid's first team, with a rating of 6.83 out of 10 based on his performances.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1150, \"end\": 1266, \"text\": \"Mollejo's teammates have also spoken highly of the young player, praising his work ethic and dedication to the team.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1267, \"end\": 1345, \"text\": \"\\\"Víctor is a great guy to have around,\\\" said Atlético Madrid midfielder, Koke.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1346, \"end\": 1432, \"text\": \"\\\"He's always looking to improve and is willing to put in the extra work to get better.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1433, \"end\": 1468, \"text\": \"He's a valuable asset to our team.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1469, \"end\": 1691, \"text\": \"In addition to his impressive statistics and glowing endorsements from his peers, Mollejo's presence on Atlético Madrid's official website and social media channels further substantiates his status as a member of the team.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1692, \"end\": 1786, \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence is clear: Víctor Mollejo is, indeed, a player for Atlético Madrid.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1787, \"end\": 1896, \"text\": \"With his talent, dedication, and enthusiasm, he is sure to be a key player for the club in the years to come.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Delaware Fightin' Blue Hens\", \"Atlético Madrid\", \"University of Delaware\", \"college basketball\", \